  "body": "https://mozilla.pettay.fi/moztests/selection_dynamic.html demonstrates that in Chrome and Firefox you can update a `Selection` object through a `Range` object. Safari does not support this (and is in line with the DOM Standard as `Range` objects do not have that capability in theory).\r\n\r\ncc @rniwa @smaug---- @foolip @tkent-google @mbrodesser",
